# Keeps the build context small, but the first two entries are about safety, not speed.

# Exam data: real student names and keys. `COPY . .` would otherwise bake these into an
# image that gets pushed to a registry and kept around.
**/.data/
apps/admin/data/
apps/admin/uploads/
apps/admin/uploads.imported/

# Local secrets. Everything the containers need is set in Coolify instead.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Rebuilt inside the image; copying host output in would ship whatever happened to be
# lying around, including a build made with the wrong origins baked in.
**/node_modules/
**/.nuxt/
**/.output/
**/dist/
apps/playground/public/assets/
apps/playground/public/__sw__.js

.git/
.idea/
.vscode/
.claude/
**/coverage/
**/.eslintcache
*.log
